﻿1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.680
La prensa ya ha llamado

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.880
the event as the wedding

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:03.680
of the century.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.160
What else could you call it?

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.240
The marriage of heirs

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.640
of the two biggest business empires.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.960
We're not letting you go

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.120
without a kiss.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.320
Kiss!

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.640
Kiss, kiss kiss kiss!

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:21.080
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.800
The show's over.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.320
Don't you dare come near me.
